:: StarrResidence-Kitchen

:: StarrResidence-BanquetHall

:: StarrResidence-Bathroom

:: StarrResidence-JanessaRoom

:: StarrResidence-PlayerRoom
    <img class="scene" src='img/plrroom.jpg'>\

    <<speech plr>>
        I'm in my room. Glancing at the state of the place, it's <<commentClean>> clean. The floor is of <<commentFloor>> quality. I see my <<commentChair>> chair and <<commentDesk>> desk in the corner. On the far wall is my <<commentBed>> bed. The room is <<commentLight>> lit.
    <</speech>>
    <<button [[Look for anything interesting in the clutter | StarrResidence-PlayerRoom-Searching]]>><</button>>
    <<button [[Try to clean up a bit | StarrResidence-PlayerRoom-Cleaning]]>>
        <<if $plrRoom.cleanliness <= 2>>
            <<set $plrRoom.cleanliness += 1>>
            <<calcTime 30>>
        <</if>>    
    <</button>>
    <<nobr>>
        <<if not hasVisited("StarrResidence-PlayerRoom-Sleeping")>>
            <<button [[Try to sleep | StarrResidence-PlayerRoom-Sleeping]]>>
                <<calcTime 30 5>>
            <</button>>
            <<else>>
            <<button "Try to sleep">>
                <<run
                    Dialog.setup("Pointless Endeavor");
                    Dialog.append("You already know you can't sleep, trying again would just be a waste of time.");
                    Dialog.open();
                >>
            <</button>>
        <</if>>
    <</nobr>>

:: StarrResidence-PlayerRoom-Cleaning
    <img class="scene" src='img/plrroom.jpg'>\
    <<nobr>>
        <<if $plrRoom.cleanliness < 1>>
            <<speech plr>>It's slow progress, but it's definitely looking cleaner. Still disgusting though...<</speech>>
        <<elseif $plrRoom.cleanliness < 3>>
            <<speech plr>>It's certainly cleaner, spending a little more time should get it looking pretty good.<</speech>>
        <<else>>
            <<speech plr>>It's as good as it can get for now.<</speech>>
        <</if>>
    <</nobr>>\

    <<button [[Continue | StarrResidence-PlayerRoom]]>><</button>>

:: StarrResidence-PlayerRoom-Searching
    <img class="scene" src='img/searchclutter.jpg'>
    <<nobr>>
        <<if $plrRoom.booksFound == 0>>
                <<searchForItem $plrRoom booksFound 3 "miscbook" "mapSchool">>
                <<speech plr>>There is more clutter to look through.<</speech>>
                <<set $unlockVar.userInterface.inventory = true>>

            <<elseif $plrRoom.booksFound == 1>>
                <<searchForItem $plrRoom booksFound 3 "miscbook" "mapTown">>
                <<speech plr>>There is a little more clutter to look through.<</speech>>

            <<elseif $plrRoom.booksFound == 2>>
                <<searchForItem $plrRoom booksFound 3 "spellbook" "illusion1">>
                <<speech plr>>There's nothing more to find here.<</speech>>

            <<else>>
                <<speech plr>>This place is picked clean.<</speech>>
        <</if>>
    <</nobr>>
    <<button [[Look back at your room | StarrResidence-PlayerRoom]]>>
    
    <</button>>

:: StarrResidence-PlayerRoom-Sleeping
    <img class="scene" src='img/nastybed.jpg'>\
    <<speech plr>>You lay down on your <<commentBed>> bed. After trying for what felt like half an hour, you realize sleep is far from a possibility.<</speech>>\

    <<button [[Stand up | StarrResidence-PlayerRoom]]>>
    <</button>>

